# Shared Utilities – Use Before Reimplementing

Before adding validation, date formatting, pipes, or home-card logic, check `src/app/shared/`. See `src/app/shared/README.md` for full docs.

## Validators (`@app/shared/validators`)
- **Email**: `emailValidator()` or `appEmailValidator` directive
- **Phone**: `phoneValidator()` or `appPhoneValidator` directive
- **Phone formatting**: `appPhoneFormatter` on `ion-input` → (123) 456-7890

## Pipes (`@app/shared/pipes`)
- **HTML with custom elements**: `SafeHtmlPipe` (trusted content only)
- **Trusted URLs** (YouTube, etc.): `SafeResourceUrlPipe`

## Models (`@app/shared/models`)
- **Home cards**: `HomeCard`, `CardType`, `CardTypeLabels`, `CardTypeIcons`, `CardTypeColors`

## Utils (`@app/shared/utils`)
- **Time range (compact)**: `formatTimeRangeCompact(start, end)` → "8:30-9:30 PM"
- **Event dates (compact)**: `formatEventDatesCompact(start, end)` → "Thu, May 21, 6-8pm"
- **Event dates (card/detail)**: `formatEventSubtitle(start, end)` → "FRIDAY, March 16, 2026 • 6:00 – 8:00 PM"
- **Date range**: `formatDateRangeCompact(start, end)` → "May 21, 2026" (single day) or "May 21 – May 22, 2026" (never "May 21 – May 21")
- **Class session**: `formatClassSessionSubtitle(session)` → "FR 6:00 – 8:00 PM\nMay 21, 2026"
- **API time string (compact)**: `formatTimeStringCompact(timeStr)` → "10-12pm"
- **API time string (full)**: `formatTimeStringFull(timeStr)` → "6:00 – 8:00 PM"
- **Day helpers**: `dayTo2Letter(day)`, `dayNumberTo2Letter(n)`
- **Notification deep link**: `mapNotificationMetaToContentType(meta)` → ContentType for routing
